  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;In the absence of sufficient detail\r\ndemonstrating that; there is no longer a need for the existing healthcare\r\nfacility, or that there are adequate similar facilities within walking distance\r\nof the site that offer equivalent healthcare provision, or that on-site medical\r\nactivities cannot be continued on-site without significantly impacting upon the\r\nliving conditions of neighbours, or that the proposed change of use would\r\nsecure an overriding public benefit, the&amp;nbsp;Council are not satisfied that\r\nthe proposed use of the site as a residential dwellinghouse would outweigh the\r\nresulting loss of the existing Medical Centre. The proposal would therefore be\r\ncontrary to the interests of the National Planning Policy Framework (2023),\r\nPolicy S2 of the London Plan (2021), Policy CS1.Z of the\r\nHarrow Core Strategy (2012), and Policy DM47 A of the Harrow Development\r\nManagement Policies Local Plan (2013).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
